Scope · Kapsam

The MIT terms above cover the SOFTWARE: everything under src/, test/, scripts/,
site/ and the configuration files.

The prose and research in this repository are a different kind of work and are
licensed separately, under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ — namely:

  - docs/yoresel-motif-arastirmasi.md
  - the motif, region and source tables in README.md and README.tr.md
  - the section copy in site/lib/icerik.ts and site/lib/kaynaklar.ts

Reuse them with attribution.

Motif meanings and regional characteristics are compiled from published
scholarship, cited in docs/ and in the Sources section of the site. Those works
remain the copyright of their own authors and publishers; this repository
quotes and cites them, and reproduces none of their images or plates.

